# Stitch (Compat-Alias)

This is a compatibility alias for older Stitch-oriented requests. For new work, use the canonical design trio directly.

## Canonical Routes

| Component | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Main design execution | `design` |
| Browser-first screen work | `web-ui-design` |
| Mobile-first screen work | `mobile-ui-design` |
| Design-system refresh | `frontend-design-system` |

## Routing

When `stitch` is requested:
1. Start with `design` as the default canonical route.
2. Choose `web-ui-design` for browser-first work unless the request is clearly mobile-first.
3. Choose `mobile-ui-design` for app-screen or Flutter-oriented work.
4. Load `frontend-design-system` only if the repo's design state or `.stitch/DESIGN.md` mirror is stale.

## Reference Skill

- `stitch`
